{"schemaVersion":1,"moduleId":"M3-01","example":{"title":"行人","intro":"以連續步行路徑為出發點，串接路段、轉角與行人穿越空間。","items":[{"id":"continuity","title":"人行動線不能只處理局部","text":"一起檢查前後路段及路口轉角，避免中斷、偏移或寬度不足迫使行人進入車道。"},{"id":"protection","title":"分隔方式配合道路風險","text":"人行道標線不具實體防護，應檢視速度與衝突條件，必要時採實體人行道或分隔。"},{"id":"crossing","title":"穿越位置與庇護空間一起安排","text":"整合行穿線、庇護島及必要的錯開配置，減少行人單次穿越的負擔。"},{"id":"signals","title":"讓行人能辨識並使用號誌","text":"檢查燈面、觸動設備與通行時相，並配合不同使用者的辨識與操作需求。"}],"moduleId":"M3-01","pageId":"results-module-m3-01","images":[{"key":"results:module-m3-01-current-1","role":"current","label":"現況問題","rotation":0},{"key":"results:module-m3-01-diagram","role":"module","label":"模組圖","rotation":0}],"source":{"file":"chapters/03-modules/08-pedestrian.typ","sha256":"484fe32436e753223409b28b75f252d295361efdea6cc69763273cbf08be47d4","title":"行人","moduleId":"M3-01","section":"現況與議題、圖例說明及延伸應用","issuePageId":"m301-sidewalk-issues","diagramPageId":"m301-sidewalk-diagram","representative":"materials/03-modules/M3-01/M3-01_人行道標線代表型1.svg"}},"assets":{"results:module-m3-01-current-1":{"file":"materials/03-modules/M3-01/M3-01.1_現況議題_01.png","width":1359,"height":575,"moduleId":"M3-01","role":"current","label":"M3-01 現況問題 1","sha256":"533e9c36ac89676367422b22e4d08688844f57e52c0dd7351b6bbf1dce7956ff"},"results:module-m3-01-diagram":{"file":"materials/03-modules/M3-01/M3-01_人行道標線代表型1.svg","width":207,"height":156,"moduleId":"M3-01","role":"module","label":"M3-01 模組圖","sha256":"ed22a8d8e5220cba0a3b40c3bac54865864db071a6f6e5c6b056d898c34fc728"}}}
